A deer slips on the ice while reaching for berries as a penguin jumps nearby, and after the deer struggles to stay awake beside the penguin, the penguin stands on railroad tracks looking at a sprout while a train speeds through the snowy landscape. The deer looks around and gasps in shock in an annoyed mood before narrowing its eyes as the train approaches the penguin, who sits eating on the track before the deer catches a berry on its tongue, tosses it, has the penguin thrown off its head, and finally sits in the snow with the penguin holding up a berry. After the deer wakes up and looks around, the pair ride in a mine cart on broken roller coaster tracks inside a cave, speeding through a tunnel while the penguin holds a bunch of berries and later eats fruit from a bunch, and the deer screams as wood structures fall and crash around it. The mine cart crashes at a mineshaft exit and launches the deer and the berries into the air, where the deer screams and flails its legs, the penguin waves while falling, and the deer gasps in alarm before crashing into the snowy landscape. After the deer lies on its back in the snow with the penguin sitting on it, the penguin slides down a snowy slope while the deer lowers its head and yawns on a rocky ledge, before the deer looks at the penguin and another penguin holding berries and finally eats berries next to the penguin while surrounded by the other penguin.
